            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-tube"><action>İç lastiği yamayın ya da değiştirin; dış lastiğin içindeki batan cismi bulun. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYABIKE" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="1" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="920" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-qr"><action>Çabuk sökme mandalını ayarlayın. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYABIKE" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="0" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="271" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-hub"><action>Göbek rulman boşluğunu ayarlayın. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYABIKE" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="271" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-true"><action>Tekerleği düzeltin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYABIKE" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA3" subSystemCode="2" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="271" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
